{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547343-concept-for-an-npc","id":1547343,"title":"Concept for an NPC","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-12-30T14:58:21-08:00","id":1547343,"title":"Concept for an NPC","content":"Evelyn Szantovich- (Clan Tzimisce/Sabbat) a 4th Generation koldun on the Path of Metamorphosis. She has clawed hands, is unnaturally muscular and stands at an abnormal height of 16 feet with an extra pair of delicate normal looking woman's arms. She has long flowing black hair and would be attractive if it weren't for her horns and six extra eyes. She often wears a black gothic dress custom-made to fit her stature. If she takes her clothes off it reveals an eerily smiling woman's face (just above the breasts) from a Revenant and two Kindred faces (below the breasts) from her two spouses/old pack members that she subsumed. Her height and musculature is from merging the bones, muscles and sinews of her two lovers with her own.<br /> <br /> Sometimes she wears a bra and loincloth or is completely nude.<br /> <br /> Nature: Deviant<br /> <br /> Demeanor: Analyst<br /> <br /> Attributes: Strength 5, Dexterity 3, Stamina 4, Charisma 4, Manipulation 3, Appearance 3, Perception 5, Intelligence 3, Wits 3<br /> <br /> Abilities: Alertness 2, Athletics 4, Brawl 2, Expression 3, Intimidation 5, Subterfuge 2, Etiquette 3, Leadership 2, Stealth 3, Survival 3, Blood Preparation 4, Linguistics 3(Romanian, Polish, Russian), Medicine 4, Body Crafts 6, Occult 3, Politics 4, Rituals 3, Science 3, Herbalism 5, Alchemy 5<br /> <br /> Backgrounds: Resources 5, Retainers 5, Contacts 5, Herd 5, Sabbat Status 3<br /> <br /> Disciplines: Auspex 8, Presence 4, Vicissitude 9, Dominate 8, Animalism 5, Koldunic Sorcery 5, Protean 5, Fortitude 3, Necromancy 5, Obfuscate 2, Potence 3 and Celerity 3<br /> <br /> Sorcerous Paths: Way of Earth 5, Way of Wind 5, Way of Water 5, Way of Fire 5, Way of Spirit 5, Transylvanian Kraina 5<br /> <br /> Necromantic Paths: Sepulchre Path 5, Bone Path 5, Ash Path 5, Corpse in the Monster 5","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 08-29-2025, 04:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-30T15:45:49-08:00","id":1547344,"title":"","content":"Her Attributes are low for a Sixth Generation vampire and she only has one Background. She has a lot of really good Disciplines, but you don\u2019t tell us how many dots she has in each Discipline.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-30T15:49:17-08:00","id":1547345,"title":"","content":"Well, considering her generation, her dots in Disciplines are going to be pretty high at least 5 or more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 12-30-2024, 07:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-30T16:02:11-08:00","id":1547346,"title":"","content":"Other than subsuming her pack into herself, her description seems derivative of Lady Dmitrescu from Resident Evil Village. I assume that is deliberate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-30T16:24:28-08:00","id":1547349,"title":"","content":"Not really deliberate I just like big muscular ladies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-30T16:32:11-08:00","id":1547351,"title":"","content":"I also got the idea from the concept of being dominated by females. I was thinking of spiders and certain species of anglerfish. She also has a twisted idea of beauty which is why she subsumed a revenant that caught her eye, adding her attractive features to her own body.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 12-30-2024, 07:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image